[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3657091633","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113919#issuecomment-3657091633","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113919","id":3657091633,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Z-sox","user":{"login":"wenekar","id":100775364,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgG1xA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100775364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenekar","html_url":"https://github.com/wenekar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenekar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenekar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenekar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenekar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenekar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenekar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenekar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenekar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenekar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-15T18:47:26Z","updated_at":"2025-12-15T18:47:26Z","body":"Yeah, I've recently noticed the same thing, this is a bug on libdecor side of things. When Godot calls libdecor_frame_commit, it should update and not do anything else, but instead, for whatever reason, it reloads the entire window per resize event. This bug is fixed in current [master of libdecor](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libdecor/libdecor) probably in commit 73fc377e. \n\nCan you confirm that this fixes for you as well by:\n```\ngit clone libdecor\nmeson setup build\nmeson install -C build # installs the library as local lib, safe\nLD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/lib godot # run Godot with locally installed version of libdecor\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3657091633/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3663274230","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113919#issuecomment-3663274230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113919","id":3663274230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7aWSD2","user":{"login":"ryi3r","id":50798713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzk4NzEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50798713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryi3r","html_url":"https://github.com/ryi3r","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryi3r/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryi3r/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryi3r/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryi3r/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryi3r/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryi3r/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryi3r/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryi3r/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryi3r/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-17T01:57:14Z","updated_at":"2025-12-17T01:57:14Z","body":"Yes, this seems to fix the issue","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3663274230/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3664971505","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113919#issuecomment-3664971505","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113919","id":3664971505,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7acwbx","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-17T11:44:21Z","updated_at":"2025-12-17T11:44:21Z","body":"CC @deralmas ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3664971505/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3665183912","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113919#issuecomment-3665183912","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113919","id":3665183912,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7adkSo","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-17T12:44:08Z","updated_at":"2025-12-17T12:44:08Z","body":"Hi, as wenekar found out it indeed seems to be a libdecor issue. Apparently it's related to #113020.\n\nLuckily it looks like this issue is [a libdecor regression](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libdecor/libdecor/-/issues/81) present only in 0.2.4, which has been out in the wild for less than two months. They already tagged a new release so this should be already over :D\n\nNow that PR #96825 got merged there's also a new `GODOT_WAYLAND_DISABLE_LIBDECOR` environment variable. Hopefully it will come in handy if someone is stuck with a broken version and doesn't need CSDs.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3665183912/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3765187918","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113919#issuecomment-3765187918","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113919","id":3765187918,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gbDVO","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-18T11:22:31Z","updated_at":"2026-01-18T11:22:31Z","body":"Well, since this was an upstream issue and it got fixed a month ago, I'd say that we can close this :D","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3765187918/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3851690214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113919#issuecomment-3851690214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113919","id":3851690214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7llCDm","user":{"login":"msim","id":976957,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3Njk1Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/976957?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim","html_url":"https://github.com/msim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-05T08:05:13Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T08:05:13Z","body":"Are we sure this is fixed?  I have libdecor 0.2.5 on an Ubuntu 26.04 beta VM with Godot 4.6 (in compatibility mode, since it's a VM).  Godot X11 window resizing is fast.  Godot wayland window resizing is still very slow.  Using GODOT_WAYLAND_DISABLE_LIBDECOR=1 with Godot wayland is fast.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3851690214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3857036186","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113919#issuecomment-3857036186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113919","id":3857036186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7l5bOa","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-05T23:54:13Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T23:54:13Z","body":"Hi, @msim. I assume you're using CSDs? The issue above seems to be related to libdecor with CSDs disabled (i.e. passing through). Maybe the picture is different with them enabled, not sure.\n\nI'd also try on bare metal with hardware acceleration, from you description you seem to describe software rendering.\n\nAlso, I guess you could try using a different plugin than the GTK plugin, like the fallback cairo/pango one (see `LIBDECOR_PLUGIN_DIR` in the [README](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libdecor/libdecor/)).\n\nThat said this would need more debugging.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3857036186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3858809588","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113919#issuecomment-3858809588","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113919","id":3858809588,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mAML0","user":{"login":"msim","id":976957,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3Njk1Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/976957?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim","html_url":"https://github.com/msim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/msim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-06T08:34:18Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T08:34:18Z","body":"I assume by \"using CSDs\" you mean the window title bar is visible, in which case yes.  i.e. it's just normal vanilla gnome desktop with wayland enabled in godot editor settings.  In which case, if that's not related to this issue then do we need a new issue for wayland window resizing being slow with CSDs enabled?\n\nThe VM I'm testing in is using hardware acceleration, everything else is perfectly smooth, even at 4K.  I also tried on an IrisXe laptop (which can run forward+), same result.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3858809588/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3865404944","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113919#issuecomment-3865404944","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113919","id":3865404944,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mZWYQ","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-07T20:47:23Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T20:47:23Z","body":"> I assume by \"using CSDs\" you mean the window title bar is visible, in which case yes. i.e. it's just normal vanilla gnome desktop with wayland enabled in godot editor settings.\n\nYes exactly that. Mutter does not expose server-side decorations on Wayland, which means that we need to do the drawing ourselves. We use libdecor for that, which can load GTK and use that to draw the titlebar in a GNOME-y way.\n\n> In which case, if that's not related to this issue then do we need a new issue for wayland window resizing being slow with CSDs enabled?\n\nYea, I think that'd be the best option. Feel free to ping me there once you open it.\n\n> The VM I'm testing in is using hardware acceleration, everything else is perfectly smooth, even at 4K. I also tried on an IrisXe laptop (which can run forward+), same result.\n\nOh all right, I guess the next step would be to try something that isn't the GTK plugin. Let's do that in the new ticket.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3865404944/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]